OL,4,CFury vs Joshua fight to go ahead       
OL,5,Cdespite objections over 3am finish     
OL,6,GCouncillors have approved plans        
OL,7,Gallowing December's highly anticipated 
OL,8,GTyson Fury v Anthony Joshua fight in   
OL,9,GCardiff to finish in the early hours.  
OL,11,FFans in hospitality boxes at the       
OL,12,FPrincipality Stadium will be allowed   
OL,13,Fto drink alcohol until 03:00, with the 
OL,14,Fvenue closing at 03:30, to align with  
OL,15,Fprime time viewing in the US.          
OL,17,FMembers of Cardiff Council's Licensing 
OL,18,FSub Committee were told 130 police     
OL,19,Fofficers would help maintain order at  
OL,20,Fthe event on 11 December, with twice   
OL,21,Fthe number of stewards present         
OL,22,Fcompared to a regular sports event.    
